      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100000110112.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">１．</span></p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai26_bk_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>あしたから <ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なんです。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Từ ngày mai tôi sẽ đi du lịch.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">２．</span></p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai26_bk_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>ばな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>習<rp>(</rp><rt>なら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたいんですが、いい <ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>紹介<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して いただけませんか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tôi muốn học cắm hoa. Bạn có thể giới thiệu cho tôi một giáo viên tốt không?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p></div>",
